haybarn-httpfs
==============

This repository is a Haybarn build-fork of the DuckDB HTTPFS extension
(github.com/duckdb/duckdb-httpfs), maintained by Query Farm LLC.

It is NOT affiliated with, sponsored by, maintained by, or endorsed by the
DuckDB Foundation or DuckDB Labs.

Purpose
-------

Haybarn (an independent derived distribution of DuckDB) rebuilds this extension
from source against the Haybarn build of DuckDB and signs it with the Haybarn
extension-signing key, so it can be served from the Haybarn extension
repository. The fork is intended to host Haybarn-specific changes on top of
the upstream source over time.

The extension is still named `httpfs` — it installs and loads exactly as
upstream:

    INSTALL httpfs;
    LOAD httpfs;

